# switchboard keeps LF in the working tree on every OS. Bash, Python, and the
# Markdown vault break or churn with CRLF, and Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true (about 1,100 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on the
# first install commit). cmd.exe batch files are the one CRLF exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
